/-!
# Four-block Helmholtz reciprocity on the exact T03 domain

Gate 816 proves symmetry of the actual Frechet Jacobian of the exact T03 Euler
covector. This module restricts that symmetry along any pair of continuous
linear injections; the four exact physical injections of Gate 817 therefore
give all ten diagonal and crossed block pairs.

The statements concern the exact functional restrictions. They introduce no
local jet residual and do not close terminal T04.
-/

